#! console --size 120x34 --config '{"console":{"titleIntro":true,"titleWeights":{"kali":1}}}'
# A console start with the Kali fold pinned: the fold opens from a deep zoom, the name rises
# through it, holds, then shrinks onto the small mark while the fold fades, and it is over.
# The clock is frozen, so each snap is the frame at that second.
wait-frame 15000 command palette
key alt-n
wait-frame 10000 untitled
tick 1000
snap opening
tick 1500
snap name-rising
tick 1500
snap held
tick 800
snap landing
tick 800
snap landed
tick 1000
snap over
quit
